<metadata><name>Day 4 (stop 1 of 2) - Black Walnut</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.108288" lon="-79.287011"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Parking Area: Provides access to the Black Walnut Side Trail</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.109068" lon="-79.281457"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turnaround point. The side trail meets the white-blazed main Bruce Trail here. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.107639" lon="-79.287077"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: You pass the start again. Keep going on the blue-blazed Black Walnut Side Trail, heading south.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.101550" lon="-79.286952"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turnaround point. The side trail meets the white-blazed main Bruce Trail here. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
